## Thermostat inner monologue
{{if({{local/slider}} >= 75, "[blink]:ph-flame|32|@danger: I am a pizza oven now. You asked for this.[/blink]", if({{local/slider}} >= 45, ":ph-thermometer-simple|32|@warning: Cozy. Borderline suspiciously cozy.", ":ph-snowflake|32|@accent: Fetch a jumper. I have chosen violence."))}}

**Setpoint vibe:** {{round({{local/slider}}, 0)}}° of personality
{{if({{local/slider}} >= 75, "[block3:Radiators plotting]", if({{local/slider}} >= 45, "[block1:Peace treaty with the cat]", "[block2:Windows judging your life choices]"))}}

### Status: domestic chaos
- **Washer:** {{if({{local/slider}} >= 55, ":ph-washing-machine|32|@accent: spinning the plot", ":ph-pause|32|@textMuted: waiting for a hero")}}
- **Dryer:** {{if({{local/slider}} >= 55, ":ph-wind|32|@warning: hot gossip", ":ph-snowflake|32|@accent: cold laundry, colder shoulder")}}
- **Coffee:** {{if({{local/slider}} >= 40, ":ph-coffee|32|@warning: bean diplomacy", ":ph-moon|32|@textMuted: unspeakable hours")}}
- **Cat flap:** {{if({{local/slider}} >= 25, ":ph-cat|32|@accent: treaty signed", ":ph-lock|32|@danger: indoor tiger protocol")}}

{{round({{local/slider}}, 0)}}% household cooperation

# Is it bedtime or a rave
{{if({{local/slider}} >= 70, ":ph-disco-ball|100|@danger:", if({{local/slider}} >= 35, ":ph-television-simple|100|@warning:", ":ph-bed|100|@accent:"))}}

{{if({{local/slider}} >= 70, "[color @danger]**Rave mode.** The disco ball has unionised.[/color]", if({{local/slider}} >= 35, "[color @warning]**One more episode.** The TV is negotiating.[/color]", "[color @accent]**Bedtime.** Even the sofa has given up.[/color]"))}}

| Check | Status |
| --- | --- |
| Kids asleep | {{if({{local/slider}} >= 30, ":ph-moon-stars: Out cold. Hide the vacuum.", ":ph-baby: Still roaming. Hide the snacks.")}} |
| Front door | {{if({{local/slider}} < 50, ":ph-lock-key: Locked. Deliveries can wait.", ":ph-lock-open: Open. The hallway is a runway.")}} |
| TV still on | {{if({{local/slider}} >= 55, ":ph-eye: Yes. It has seen things.", ":ph-eye-slash: Off. Finally.")}} |

{{if({{local/slider}} < 30, "[color @accent]**All quiet.** The house will allow sleep.[/color]", "[color @warning]**Not yet.** Someone is just checking one more thing.[/color]")}}

{{if({{local/slider}} < 15, ":ph-battery-empty|112|#ef4444:", "")}}{{if(and({{local/slider}} >= 15, {{local/slider}} < 35), ":ph-battery-low|112|#f97316:", "")}}{{if(and({{local/slider}} >= 35, {{local/slider}} < 50), ":ph-battery-medium|112|#f97316:", "")}}{{if(and({{local/slider}} >= 50, {{local/slider}} < 65), ":ph-battery-high|112|#22c55e:", "")}}{{if(and({{local/slider}} >= 65, {{local/slider}} < 85), ":ph-battery-full|112|#22c55e:", "")}}{{if({{local/slider}} >= 85, ":ph-battery-charging|112|#3b82f6:", "")}}

# {{round({{local/slider}}, 0)}}%
{{if({{local/slider}} >= 85, "[color #3b82f6]Docked and pretending to work.[/color]", if({{local/slider}} >= 50, "[color #22c55e]Vacuum has enough juice to judge you.[/color]", "[blink][color #ef4444]It has given up. Bring snacks to the charger.[/color][/blink]"))}}
